{"script":"sj_037_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]以吾看来，施主的实力已非泛泛，想要再进一步，恐非一日之功。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]施主之所以认为自己不够强，只是因为你交游广阔，谈笑有高人，往来无弱手。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]你却忘了，他们本来就是各自领域的顶尖人物，你比不过实数应当。就好像你一定要与别人比拼工匠技艺，本来与欺负人无异。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]像是施主这样自成一派的好手，战斗风格早已定型，除非拜我门下，由吾给你全部推翻，重新训练，否则实在难以一蹴而就。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]不过施主曾说要专心工匠技艺，无心他顾，这一条路想来是不成的了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]为今之计，只能由吾点拨你一些粗浅拳脚，看你自己悟性，能否融会贯通。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]这当然绝非一时可成，但我想施主也不必心急。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]毕竟你有很多值得相信的伙伴，不要吝于依靠他们，尽管借助大家的力量，合众一心，方可功成啊！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"剋-大师在观察什么？"}